 1-1  Skel-Updater
 ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
 SKEL-UPDATER IS A UTIL THAT RUNS IN ALL YOUR LOGOFF SCRIPTS!

 YOU MUST PLACE THE SKEL-UPDATER UTIL IN ALL! YOUR LOGOFF SCRIPTS! AND IT MUST
 BE THE FIRST THING RUN IN THE SCRIPTS, DONT WORRY IT IS A FAST UTIL!

 If you don't use SKEL-Updater in all logoffs then SKEL-ULC can be used as a
 replacement, SKEL-ULC does the updater work as well as generates a last
 caller output.

 =====================
 === WHAT IT DOES: ===
 =====================

 This util will store information to many .data files in your setup directory.
 The data stored will have information that many of my other utils will read
 in and use.

 Data Files Created:

 Records.Data    - Stores the record stats of all time.
 History.Data    - Stores the history of stats for last 30 days.
 Current.Data    - Stores the Current Stats for use by many of the skel utils.

 You must run this Util before running my other utils!!

 Tempest Programmers: If you would like to use my .data file for your utils too
 then leave me a message.. I will give you the structure info for your utils to
 read the data files too.


 - Stores stats from yesterday
 - Stores the history of stats for last 30 days
 - Stores all time record high stats
 - Stores Stats for the current day


 Usage:
 ~~~~~
 SKEL-UPDATER 5 TEMPEST:
     |        |    |
     |        |    `-------> Path of Main Tempest directory.
     |        |
     |        `------------> Number of Nodes.
     |
     `---------------------> SKEL-UPDATER Util.


